# 🛒 Smart Matrix – AI Powered Grocery & Delivery Management System

A full-stack Django-based smart grocery platform with AI-powered product recommendations, OTP verification, secure payments, delivery tracking, and multi-user management.

---

 🚀 Features

 👤 User Module
- OTP-based email registration & verification
- Secure login authentication
- Browse & search products
- AI-based recipe product recommendation
- Add to cart & preorder system
- Secure encrypted payment system
- View payment history
- Live chat with shop
- Booking & order tracking
- Feedback & rating system

---

 🏪 Shop Module
- Shop registration with approval system
- Add / update / delete products
- Manage inventory & stock
- View orders & assign delivery boys
- Chat with customers
- Sales analytics & monthly reports
- Manage delivery salaries
- Customer feedback analysis

---

 🚚 Delivery Boy Module
- OTP verification login
- View assigned deliveries
- Update delivery status
- Track completed orders
- View salary earnings

---

 👨‍💼 Admin Module
- Manage users, shops & delivery boys
- Approve / reject registrations
- Product monitoring
- Feedback management
- Revenue & salary reports
- Platform activity analytics

---

 🤖 AI Recommendation Engine
Integrated recipe-based product recommendation system using:

- Pandas
- CSV Dataset Processing
- Smart ingredient matching
- Search-based product suggestions

Users can search recipes, and the system recommends matching grocery products automatically.

---

 🔐 Security Features
- Password encryption
- OTP email verification
- Encrypted card storage
- Secure authentication session handling

---

 🛠️ Tech Stack

Backend
